    "detailed_description": "<strong>Gatherings</strong> is a 2 to 8 player party game designed to ruin any remaining friendships you may still have. Create a Lobby, gather your friends and dive right in! No board, no drawn-out game modes, just pure fun, excitement and chaotic, friendship destroying action.<br><br>But try to make peace with your friends before the end of each game tho, <strong>Gatherings</strong> is not meant to be a single player game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Party in Action</strong></h2><br>Get your friends together, create or join a lobby, pick your character, and hit start! The first player to reach the lobby score limit takes home the crown.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889380/extras/f9f34d5a6851b8a78a2bd52716013fb8.poster.avif?t=1748019816\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889380/extras/f9f34d5a6851b8a78a2bd52716013fb8.webm?t=1748019816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889380/extras/f9f34d5a6851b8a78a2bd52716013fb8.mp4?t=1748019816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Not a fan of certain Mini-Games ?</strong> - No problem! Disable the ones you don\u2019t like and customize the experience to your liking.<br></li><li><strong>Short on Time ?</strong> - Adjust the score limit and play a quick session, so Gatherings fits your schedule no matter how busy things get.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's on the menu ?</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889380/extras/56a097244c0c2b618f1dbe1119e5e46d.poster.avif?t=1748019816\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889380/extras/56a097244c0c2b618f1dbe1119e5e46d.webm?t=1748019816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889380/extras/56a097244c0c2b618f1dbe1119e5e46d.mp4?t=1748019816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>No board</strong> - Jump in the action, It\u2019s all gameplay, all the time!<br></li><li><strong>Up to 8 players online</strong> - Whether you\u2019re rolling with a full crew or just a few friends, the mini-games adapt to the size of your party!<br></li><li><strong>20+ chaotic, skill based minigames</strong> - Classic shooter, racing, cooking, platformer, physics based madness, there\u2019s always a mini-game where you can (try to) shine.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Here's a <i>taste</i> of what's in store :</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889380/extras/09bf053356bc9e0a91cdb2f47fa99f37.poster.avif?t=1748019816\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889380/extras/09bf053356bc9e0a91cdb2f47fa99f37.webm?t=1748019816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889380/extras/09bf053356bc9e0a91cdb2f47fa99f37.mp4?t=1748019816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Deceitful Dungeon</strong> - Ah, the thrill of taking down mobs with friends... except for that one who keeps swiping your loot, right? Well, that's the twist in this game: team up to slay the mobs and make sure you grab the most loot to come out on top!<br></li><li><strong>Cooking chaos</strong> - Cooperation is key in the kitchen, but what happens when everyone\u2019s out for themselves? Compete to see who can deliver the most dishes and claim victory!<br></li><li><strong>Platformer madness</strong> - Ever played those game where the only goal is to go up ? Now imagine doing that with your friends\u2014only this time, you can knock them down when they get a little too good for your liking!<br></li><li><strong>Transport Takedown</strong> - Load up your pickup and race to fill your warehouse with the most cargo! But beware\u2014it's not just about hauling your own stuff; you can also steal from your friends! </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889380/extras/b8a1a61e4540946092df2200476f22fd.poster.avif?t=1748019816\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889380/extras/b8a1a61e4540946092df2200476f22fd.webm?t=1748019816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889380/extras/b8a1a61e4540946092df2200476f22fd.mp4?t=1748019816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>And many more mini games including, gungames, racing game, time attack, memory game and some original concept that you'll enjoy discovering! </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You have feedback?</h2><br>Please join us on our discord (you'll find the link on the right panel) or share you thought through Steam Community forums. <br>We're a team of three friends doing this part time, yet we push updates very regularly based on <strong>your</strong> feedback, so don't be shy come on in!",
